        'content' => `1. Open Your Heart2. Lucky Star3. True Blue4. Papa Don't Preach5. White Heat6. Causing a Commotion7. The Look of Love8. Dress You Up9. Material Girl10. Like a Virgin (contient un extrait de I Can't Help Myself (Sugar Pie Honey Bunch))11. Where's the Party12. Live to Tell13. Into the Groove14. La Isla Bonita15. Who's That Girl16. Holiday`,
