        Movies::create(
        ['title' => `Cher: Live in Concert`,
        'content' => `I still haven't found what I'm looking for - All or nothing - The power - We all sleep alone - I found someone - The way of love - Half breed - Gypsie, tramps &amp; thieves - Dark lady - Take me home - After all - Walking in Memphis - Just like Jesse James - The shoop shoop song - Dov'è l'amore - Strong enough - If I could turn back time - Believe`,
