        'content' => `the follow up to the wildly creative A HAPPY MEDIUM, #2 is much anticipated With the line up being Aaron Jaws Homoki, Eric Thomas, Kody Kohlman, Jeff Stevens, John Rob Moore, Brett Woodward, Derek Tracy, Tyler Franz, Riley Hawk, Josh Hawkins, John Motta and more. I can't wait to see Motta!`,
